{
  "comment": "G1 method table \u2014 source of truth for tool/three/build_1b_bindings.py (M2a). Locked ABI: [u32 opcode LE][args...]; format chars u=u32 i=i32 f=f32 s=u32 len+UTF-8 (also emits aK_len u32) b=u32 len+raw bytes (a number instead of a typed array writes the length ONLY = size-only/null-data convention; the decoder sees a NULL pointer; a zero-length blob at the end of the buffer is also NULL, so JS null == empty upload). ret: void|i32|u32|name|scratch. name = C glue allocates via glGen/glCreate and sets rv to the GL name. scratch = data written into the 64 KB per-context scratch, fetched via a1b_gl_result. 'c' is the C case-body glue (locals a0..aN per format, rv preset 0, sc/sc_len = scratch). WebGL -1 uniform locations arrive as 0xFFFFFFFF and are guarded no-ops in glue.",
